# Qualys WAS exclude list - one host or fnmatch pattern per line.
# Copy this file to qualys_exclude.txt (next to main.py) and add your entries.
# Hosts matching any line here are NOT created/scheduled/scanned in Qualys WAS when running with -q.
# qualys_exclude.txt is auto-detected - no flag needed. Blank lines and lines starting with # are
# ignored. Matching is case-insensitive.
#
# Examples:
#   dev.example.com          exact host
#   *.staging.example.com    any subdomain of staging.example.com
#   test-*                   any host starting with test-
#   *.internal.example.com
